  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4298c1582b1a1b6428acd6f21334c2fe, type: 3}
  m_Name: ArthurM1R12
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  Name:
    textVI: Arthur
    textEN: Arthur
  CharSprite: {fileID: -7441139868736287282, guid: 3fb32fc0d0568c84889ab091781a1772, type: 3}
  DialogueLines:
  - IsYou: 0
    textVI: "Ch\xFAc m\u1EEBng! C\u1EADu \u0111\xE3 l\u1EF1a ch\u1ECDn \u0111\xFAng
      con \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng!"
    textEN: Congratulations! You have walked the true path!
    autoSkip: 0
  - IsYou: 0
    textVI: "Nh\u01B0ng \u0111\u1EEBng v\u1ED9i m\u1EEBng, c\u1EADu v\u1EABn c\xF2n
      k\u1EBB th\xF9 tr\u01B0\u1EDBc m\u1EAFt ph\u1EA3i ng\u0103n ch\u1EB7n! Ch\u1EAFc
      h\u1EB3n c\u1EADu c\u0169ng \u0111\xE3 \u0111o\xE1n ra h\u1EAFn l\xE0 ai."
    textEN: But do not celebrate just yet. There is still a foe ahead that you must
      thwart. Surely, you have already guessed who he is.
    autoSkip: 0
  - IsYou: 0
    textVI: "H\u1EAFn ta \u0111\xE3 \u0111i qu\xE1 xa, kh\xF4ng bi\u1EBFt h\u1EAFn
      \u0111\xE3 ch\u1EA1m t\u1EDBi c\xE1c h\u1EA1t b\u1ED5n nguy\xEAn c\xF2n l\u1EA1i
      ch\u01B0a, n\u1EBFu h\u1EAFn \u0111\xE3 h\u1EE7y di\u1EC7t ch\xFAng, c\u1EA3
      h\u1EC7 sinh th\xE1i c\u1EE7a th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi s\u1EBD b\u1ECB \u0111\u1EA3o
      l\u1ED9n."
    textEN: He has gone too far. I wonder if he has already reached the remaining
      Origin Seeds. If he has destroyed them, the entire world's ecosystem will be
      thrown into chaos.
    autoSkip: 0
  - IsYou: 1
    textVI: "T\xF4i s\u1EBD kh\xF4ng ch\xF9n b\u01B0\u1EDBc, \xE1nh s\xE1ng s\u1EBD
      soi r\u1ECDi m\xE0n \u0111\xEAm \u0111en t\u1ED1i, cho c\u1EA3 h\u1EAFn v\xE0
      c\u1EA3 v\u01B0\u01A1ng qu\u1ED1c n\xE0y. N\u1EBFu t\xF4i th\u1EA5t b\u1EA1i
      th\xEC..."
    textEN: I will not falter. The light will pierce the dark night, for both him
      and this entire kingdom. If I should fail, then...
    autoSkip: 0
  - IsYou: 1
    textVI: "Kh\xF4ng, t\xF4i s\u1EBD kh\xF4ng th\u1EA5t b\u1EA1i!"
    textEN: No, I will not fail!
    autoSkip: 0
  EndDialogue: 
  AutoProgressDelay: 1.5
  TypingSpeed: 0.05
  VoiceSound: {fileID: 0}
  VoicePitch: 1
  IsActivated: 0
